<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Berthoud Blues Bash | Bayou Smokehouse</title>
<meta name="description" content="A free day of blues, brews, and Southern food in Berthoud, CO. Saturday, November 14, 2026 at City Star Brewing.">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Alfa+Slab+One&family=Bree+Serif&family=Source+Sans+3:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/blues-bash.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="bb-header">
  <div class="bb-header__inner">
    <a href="#top" class="bb-header__brand">Berthoud Blues Bash</a>
    <nav class="bb-nav" id="bb-primary-nav">
      <a href="#lineup">Lineup</a>
      <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a>
      <a href="#location">Location</a>
      <a href="#food">Food &amp; Drink</a>
      <a href="#sponsors">Sponsors</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <button type="button" class="bb-nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bb-primary-nav" aria-label="Toggle menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="bb-hero" id="top">
    <div class="bb-hero__image" style="background-image: url('/images/blues-bash/delta-sonics-pic3.png');"></div>
    <div class="bb-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="bb-hero__content">
      <img src="/images/blues-bash/Berthoud-Blues-Bash-logo-web.png" alt="Berthoud Blues Bash" class="bb-hero__logo">
      <p class="bb-hero__presented">Presented by Bayou Smokehouse &amp; City Star Brewing</p>
      <p class="bb-hero__tagline">A Day of Blues, Brews, and the Best Damn Southern Food</p>
      <p class="bb-hero__details">
        Saturday, November 14, 2026 &bull; 12:00 PM&ndash;8:00 PM<br>
        City Star Brewing &bull; 321 Mountain Ave, Berthoud, CO 80513
      </p>
      <div class="bb-hero__cta-row">
        <span class="bb-hero__badge">Free Admission</span>
        <a href="#lineup" class="bb-hero__scroll-cta" aria-label="Scroll down to the lineup">
          <span>More</span>
          <svg class="bb-hero__scroll-arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section" id="lineup">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>The Lineup</h2>
      <p class="bb-section__intro">Five acts, one stage, a full day of blues with sound by <a href="https://foxymusic.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Foxy Music Productions</a>. See what people are sayin&rsquo; or click Read more to meet each artist.</p>

      <div class="bb-quotes" id="bb-quotes">
        <button type="button" class="bb-quotes__arrow bb-quotes__arrow--prev" data-quotes-prev aria-label="Previous quote">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>

        <div class="bb-quotes__viewport">
          <% quotes.forEach(function(quote, i) { %>
            <div
              class="bb-quotes__slide<% if (i === 0) { %> is-active<% } %>"
              role="button"
              tabindex="0"
              aria-label="Show next quote"
              <% if (i !== 0) { %>hidden<% } %>
            >
              <blockquote class="bb-quotes__quote">
                <p class="bb-quotes__text"><% if (quote.type === 'quote') { %>&ldquo;<%= quote.text %>&rdquo;<% } else { %><%= quote.text %><% } %></p>
                <footer class="bb-quotes__footer">
                  <cite><%= quote.attribution %></cite>
                  <% if (quote.artist) { %><span class="bb-quotes__artist">on <%= quote.artist %></span><% } %>
                </footer>
              </blockquote>
            </div>
          <% }); %>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="bb-quotes__arrow bb-quotes__arrow--next" data-quotes-next aria-label="Next quote">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="bb-lineup-carousel">
        <button type="button" class="bb-lineup-arrow bb-lineup-arrow--prev" data-lineup-prev aria-label="Scroll to previous artist">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>

        <div class="bb-lineup-track" id="bb-lineup-track">
          <% artists.forEach(function(artist) { %>
            <article class="bb-artist-card">
              <div class="bb-artist-card__photo">
                <img src="<%= artist.photo %>" alt="<%= artist.name %> performing" loading="lazy" style="object-position: center <%= artist.photoPosition || 'center' %>;">
                <% if (artist.isHeadliner) { %><span class="bb-artist-card__badge">Headliner</span><% } %>
              </div>
              <div class="bb-artist-card__body">
                <h3><%= artist.name %></h3>
                <p class="bb-artist-card__time"><%= artist.setStart %>&ndash;<%= artist.setEnd %></p>
                <p class="bb-artist-card__bio-preview"><%= artist.tileBio %></p>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="bb-artist-card__more"
                  data-artist-modal-trigger
                  data-name="<%= artist.name %>"
                  data-photo="<%= artist.photo %>"
                  data-photo-position="<%= artist.modalPhotoPosition || 'top' %>"
                  data-bio="<%= artist.popupBio %>"
                  data-time="<%= artist.setStart %>&ndash;<%= artist.setEnd %>"
                  data-headliner="<%= artist.isHeadliner ? '1' : '' %>"
                  <% if (artist.musicUrl) { %>data-music-url="<%= artist.musicUrl %>"<% } %>
                  <% if (artist.websiteUrl) { %>data-website-url="<%= artist.websiteUrl %>"<% } %>
                >Read More</button>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% }); %>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="bb-lineup-arrow bb-lineup-arrow--next" data-lineup-next aria-label="Scroll to next artist">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <dialog class="bb-artist-modal" id="bb-artist-modal">
    <button type="button" class="bb-artist-modal__close" data-artist-modal-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <img class="bb-artist-modal__photo" id="bb-artist-modal-photo" src="" alt="">
    <div class="bb-artist-modal__body">
      <span class="bb-artist-card__badge bb-artist-modal__badge" id="bb-artist-modal-badge" hidden>Headliner</span>
      <h3 id="bb-artist-modal-name"></h3>
      <p class="bb-artist-card__time" id="bb-artist-modal-time"></p>
      <div id="bb-artist-modal-bio"></div>
      <div class="bb-artist-modal__links" id="bb-artist-modal-links"></div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <section class="bb-section bb-section--alt" id="schedule">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>Schedule</h2>
      <ul class="bb-timeline">
        <li class="bb-timeline__row">
          <span class="bb-timeline__time">12:00 PM</span>
          <span class="bb-timeline__event">Doors Open</span>
        </li>
        <% artists.forEach(function(artist) { %>
          <li class="bb-timeline__row">
            <span class="bb-timeline__time"><%= artist.setStart %>&ndash;<%= artist.setEnd %></span>
            <span class="bb-timeline__event">
              <%= artist.name %>
              <% if (artist.isHeadliner) { %><em class="bb-timeline__tag">Headliner</em><% } %>
            </span>
            <% if (artist.musicUrl) { %>
              <a href="<%= artist.musicUrl %>" class="bb-timeline__listen" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Listen</a>
            <% } %>
          </li>
        <% }); %>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section" id="location">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>Location &amp; Venue</h2>
      <p>
        City Star Brewing<br>
        321 Mountain Ave, Berthoud, CO 80513
      </p>
      <p>Parking is in downtown Berthoud rather than at the venue itself: look for the lots on 3rd St, plus street parking nearby. Carpooling and rideshare are welcome.</p>
      <div class="bb-map">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=City+Star+Brewing,321+Mountain+Ave,Berthoud,CO+80513&output=embed"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Map to City Star Brewing"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section bb-section--alt" id="food">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>Food &amp; Drink</h2>
      <p>
        Bayou Smokehouse will be on site all day serving up Southern and Cajun favorites, smoked low and slow. City
        Star Brewing's taproom keeps the craft beer flowing right where the music is happening.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section" id="sponsors">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>Sponsors</h2>

      <div class="bb-sponsor-logos">
        <% sponsors.forEach(function(sponsor) { %>
          <% if (sponsor.logo && sponsor.url) { %>
            <a href="<%= sponsor.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bb-sponsor-logos__item">
              <img src="<%= sponsor.logo %>" alt="<%= sponsor.name %>">
            </a>
          <% } else if (sponsor.logo) { %>
            <span class="bb-sponsor-logos__item"><img src="<%= sponsor.logo %>" alt="<%= sponsor.name %>"></span>
          <% } else { %>
            <span class="bb-sponsor-logos__item bb-sponsor-logos__item--text"><%= sponsor.name %></span>
          <% } %>
        <% }); %>
      </div>

      <div class="bb-founding-sponsor">
        <h3>Founding Community Sponsor: $100</h3>
        <p class="bb-founding-sponsor__tag">Available exclusively for our inaugural year</p>
        <p>
          Individuals, families, and businesses can become part of Berthoud Blues Bash history by helping us get the
          very first one off the ground.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>One official Berthoud Blues Bash event T-shirt</li>
          <li>Two complimentary beverages at City Star Brewing on the day of the event</li>
          <li>Name listed as a Founding Member of the Berthoud Blues Bash</li>
          <li>Recognition on the 2026 Founding Members display</li>
          <li>Inclusion in our Founding Sponsors social media recognition</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="bb-founding-sponsor__note">
          The Founding Member designation is exclusive to supporters of the First Annual Berthoud Blues Bash.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact?category=founding_sponsor" class="bb-btn bb-btn--primary">Become a Founding Sponsor</a>
      </div>

      <p class="bb-sponsor-cta">
        Interested in a larger sponsorship package? We're putting together a full sponsor pack for local
        businesses.<br>
        <a href="/contact?category=sponsorship" class="bb-btn bb-btn--primary">Contact Us About Sponsoring</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bb-section bb-section--alt" id="faq">
    <div class="bb-container">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>

      <details class="bb-faq-item">
        <summary>When and where is the Berthoud Blues Bash?</summary>
        <p>Saturday, November 14, 2026, 12:00 PM to 8:00 PM, at City Star Brewing, 321 Mountain Ave, Berthoud, CO 80513.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bb-faq-item">
        <summary>Do I need a ticket?</summary>
        <p>
          Nope. The Berthoud Blues Bash is a free event, open to everyone. If you'd like to help support the
          festival's first year, check out becoming a Founding Community Sponsor below.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="bb-faq-item">
        <summary>Is the festival indoors or outdoors?</summary>
        <p>
          The event takes place rain, snow, or shine. Dress for Colorado's unpredictable November weather. Check
          back here closer to the date for specifics on indoor and outdoor space at City Star Brewing.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="bb-faq-item">
        <summary>Are children allowed to attend?</summary>
        <p>
          The Berthoud Blues Bash is an all-ages event. Attendees under 18 must be accompanied by a parent or legal
          guardian.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="bb-faq-item">
        <summary>Where can I park?</summary>
        <p>
          Parking is in downtown Berthoud rather than at the venue itself. There are a couple of lots on 3rd St,
          plus street parking nearby, on a first-come, first-served basis. Carpooling and rideshare are encouraged.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="bb-footer">
  <div class="bb-container bb-footer__inner">
    <p>
      Presented by
      <a href="https://www.bayousmokehouseco.com">Bayou Smokehouse</a>
      &amp;
      City Star Brewing
    </p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Berthoud Blues Bash</p>
    <a href="/" class="bb-footer__back">&larr; Back to Bayou Smokehouse</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/js/blues-bash.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
